  "duration_s": 523.448276,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九六四年十月十六日，新疆罗布泊内一声巨响，撕裂长空，一团蘑菇云拔地而起，全中国都沸腾了。北京街头人山人海，全世界都懵了。那个穷的叮当响被人封锁了个严严实实的中国，怎么就造出为国争气的原子弹呢？可各位，你们想过没有？这枚原子弹背后站着一个伟大女人没有他，中国第一颗核爆的心脏至少还要多卡好几年。诡异的是什么呢？成功之后，所有的报纸上找不到他的名字。所有的庆功队伍里看不见他的人，他就像人间蒸发了一样，一消失就是三十年。他去哪儿了？他是什么身份？他为什么要消失？今天我就带你认识下这位中国最不能出名的女科学家。王成书故事得从老上海说起。一九一二年六月二十六日，王成书出生在上海一个书香门第，名字取自尚书家里四个姐妹，她排行第二，是全家的真人计算器。家里人经常喊二小姐，快来算个账。没办法，这姑娘数学考试从来都是第一。一九三零年十八岁的他考进燕京大学物理系。那一年，物理系只招了十三个学生，其中十二个男的和一个女的。那个女学生就是她那个年代什么风言风语都有说什么女孩子读什么理科王成书，不吵不闹，不打架，他就考试。从大一考到大四，全系总是第一雷打不动。一九三四年毕业，他们那一届十三个人，最后拿到学位的只有四个人，他还是榜首，甚至还捧走了学校的最高荣誉金钥匙奖。他要强还拼命。一九三六年拿下了燕大硕士留校任教。一九三九年战火纷飞他和物理学家张文玉在昆明成了婚。一九四一年两口子一起赴美留学，进了密歇根大学王成书，败在世界物理学权威人物乌伦贝克门下王成书，这个学生有多恐怖？一九四四年拿到博士学位。一九五一年，他和导师一起解开了困扰国际学界多年的气体书韵难题。方程直接以两个人的姓氏命名王成书乌伦贝克方程简称WCU方程学术发表即轰动世件。直到今天，这个领域的论文里，还在引用导师乌伦贝克放话，我这个学生只要留在美国诺贝尔奖就是时间问题。诺贝尔奖啊朋友们，多少人一辈子摸不着边的东西，在他那儿就是个时间问题，可就在这个节骨眼上。一九四九年十月一日，新中国成立的消息漂洋过海，王成书和张文玉做了个让所有美国同行崩溃的决定，回到祖国美国这边不放牛。朝鲜战争刚刚爆发，美方直接禁止中国学者李靖中间不乏监视传讯扣资料。有个美国教授说的更直白了，这些人回去就是潜在的核武制造者，越阻拦，他越铁了心。为了保住科研资料，他把书刊分成三百多个邮包，跑去不同的邮局，像蚂蚁搬家一样一点点寄回北京邮包的重量加起来足足有九百公斤左右。夹当宋人的宋人，美方开出再优渥的条件，他眼皮都不抬一下。整整七年的时间，国家在日内瓦谈判上据理力争，美国不得不解除禁令。一九五六年十月，双脚一踏上祖国的土地，他在笔记里就写在离别的十五年的祖国国境上。第一次看到五星红旗在空中飘扬，心里说不出的兴奋。我要为国家做贡献，国家需要什么，我就干什么这话，他真就用一辈子去兑现。一九五八年，前三强上门找，他说国家要建热核聚变研究室，国内这个项目还一片空白，让你挑头干不干。他已经四十六岁，专业已经定了型，这跟研究了二十年的锡箔气体，根本是两码事儿，等于从教授退回小学生，但是他只回了仨字，我愿意。一九六一年，苏联的专家全部撤走，图纸也卷走，核抱最要命的一步，浓缩又卡死了，前三强把话给他挑明了。这件事要绝对保密，不能发表论文，不能出席任何学术会议去向。不能告诉任何人，包括你的丈夫，干这个项目等于物理学家王成书，这个人就在社会上消失了。四十九岁的他还是那三个字，我愿意。一九九六二年，他悄悄离京去了甘肃兰州的武陵寺场，丈夫在外承担任务，儿子一个人在北京读寄宿学校，一家三口天各一方。他提出分九批启动第五批取料的方案，把投产周期整整缩短了一百一十三天。一九六四年一月十四日，新中国第一批风度百分之九十以上的合格核燃料下线。九个月后，罗布泊一声巨响，聂荣臻向毛主席汇报成功的消息。毛主席说，这是中国第一颗核爆的女功臣，可举国欢庆的人群里，根本没有王成书，组织上询问他继续隐姓埋名干下去，你愿意吗？我愿意。第三次，王成书又答应了下来，从此他继续藏，一直藏到一九七七年才回到北京。一九八零年当选中国科学院学部委员，可老百姓压根儿不知道他是谁。一九九四年六月十八日，八十二岁的王成书病逝，当众公布遗嘱时，所有人沉默了不办丧事，遗体捐给医学研究毕昇书籍资料，送给核工业研究院零存整取的七千两百二十二点八八元作为最后一次党费上交，其余约十万元的积蓄全部捐给国家的希望工程。他本可以站在诺贝尔奖的领奖台台上，最后却站在大西北的稿纸堆里。他本可以名满天下，最后连儿子都不知道妈妈这些年到底在哪在干些什么。这就是王成书蘑菇云里有他的一份，他却不肯留自己的名字，王成书的故事就写在国之脊梁。这本书里，书中还有四十多位，像他这样的人，每一位拿出来都能让你红着眼况。看完想要深入了解这些为国隐身的国之脊梁，点左下角链接直接带走，给自己看，给孩子看都值得。但这只是开始一个能拿诺贝尔奖的女人，为什么心甘情愿消失三十年？他在美国被扣的那七年到底经历了什么？关注我，下一集更震撼。如果你被这个故事触动到了，点个赞，收藏起来，转发给您的家人、朋友一起来看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 2070,
      "text": "一九六四年十月十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2070,
      "end_ms": 4890,
      "text": "新疆罗布泊内一声巨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5070,
      "end_ms": 5910,
      "text": "撕裂长空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6370,
      "end_ms": 8350,
      "text": "一团蘑菇云拔地而起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8710,
      "end_ms": 10330,
      "text": "全中国都沸腾了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10870,
      "end_ms": 12850,
      "text": "北京街头人山人海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13350,
      "end_ms": 14770,
      "text": "全世界都懵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14950,
      "end_ms": 19370,
      "text": "那个穷的叮当响被人封锁了个严严实实的中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19790,
      "end_ms": 22950,
      "text": "怎么就造出为国争气的原子弹呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23990,
      "end_ms": 24570,
      "text": "可各位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24750,
      "end_ms": 25890,
      "text": "你们想过没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26250,
      "end_ms": 31440,
      "text": "这枚原子弹背后站着一个伟大女人没有他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00013",
      "start_ms": 32320,
      "end_ms": 36700,
      "text": "中国第一颗核爆的心脏至少还要多卡好几年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36880,
      "end_ms": 38240,
      "text": "诡异的是什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00015",
      "start_ms": 38920,
      "end_ms": 39920,
      "text": "成功之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00016",
      "start_ms": 40280,
      "end_ms": 43580,
      "text": "所有的报纸上找不到他的名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00017",
      "start_ms": 44360,
      "end_ms": 47580,
      "text": "所有的庆功队伍里看不见他的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00018",
      "start_ms": 48420,
      "end_ms": 50680,
      "text": "他就像人间蒸发了一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00019",
      "start_ms": 51120,
      "end_ms": 53140,
      "text": "一消失就是三十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00020",
      "start_ms": 54060,
      "end_ms": 54940,
      "text": "他去哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00021",
      "start_ms": 55800,
      "end_ms": 56980,
      "text": "他是什么身份？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00022",
      "start_ms": 57260,
      "end_ms": 58600,
      "text": "他为什么要消失？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00023",
      "start_ms": 59120,
      "end_ms": 66175,
      "text": "今天我就带你认识下这位中国最不能出名的女科学家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00024",
      "start_ms": 66670,
      "end_ms": 69695,
      "text": "王成书故事得从老上海说起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00025",
      "start_ms": 70350,
      "end_ms": 72165,
      "text": "一九一二年六月二十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00026",
      "start_ms": 72660,
      "end_ms": 75600,
      "text": "王成书出生在上海一个书香门第，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00027",
      "start_ms": 75680,
      "end_ms": 78640,
      "text": "名字取自尚书家里四个姐妹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00028",
      "start_ms": 78640,
      "end_ms": 79585,
      "text": "她排行第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00029",
      "start_ms": 79960,
      "end_ms": 82065,
      "text": "是全家的真人计算器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00030",
      "start_ms": 82690,
      "end_ms": 84735,
      "text": "家里人经常喊二小姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00031",
      "start_ms": 84940,
      "end_ms": 85755,
      "text": "快来算个账。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00032",
      "start_ms": 86710,
      "end_ms": 87405,
      "text": "没办法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00033",
      "start_ms": 87720,
      "end_ms": 90075,
      "text": "这姑娘数学考试从来都是第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00034",
      "start_ms": 90690,
      "end_ms": 95325,
      "text": "一九三零年十八岁的他考进燕京大学物理系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00035",
      "start_ms": 95890,
      "end_ms": 96450,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00036",
      "start_ms": 96470,
      "end_ms": 98635,
      "text": "物理系只招了十三个学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00037",
      "start_ms": 99070,
      "end_ms": 101675,
      "text": "其中十二个男的和一个女的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00038",
      "start_ms": 101980,
      "end_ms": 109580,
      "text": "那个女学生就是她那个年代什么风言风语都有说什么女孩子读什么理科王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00039",
      "start_ms": 109620,
      "end_ms": 110400,
      "text": "不吵不闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00040",
      "start_ms": 110420,
      "end_ms": 110995,
      "text": "不打架，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00041",
      "start_ms": 111310,
      "end_ms": 112005,
      "text": "他就考试。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00042",
      "start_ms": 112620,
      "end_ms": 114095,
      "text": "从大一考到大四，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00043",
      "start_ms": 114510,
      "end_ms": 117085,
      "text": "全系总是第一雷打不动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00044",
      "start_ms": 117920,
      "end_ms": 119425,
      "text": "一九三四年毕业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00045",
      "start_ms": 119890,
      "end_ms": 121450,
      "text": "他们那一届十三个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00046",
      "start_ms": 121990,
      "end_ms": 123970,
      "text": "最后拿到学位的只有四个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00047",
      "start_ms": 124570,
      "end_ms": 125530,
      "text": "他还是榜首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00048",
      "start_ms": 126170,
      "end_ms": 129650,
      "text": "甚至还捧走了学校的最高荣誉金钥匙奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00049",
      "start_ms": 130310,
      "end_ms": 131630,
      "text": "他要强还拼命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00050",
      "start_ms": 132490,
      "end_ms": 136470,
      "text": "一九三六年拿下了燕大硕士留校任教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00051",
      "start_ms": 136830,
      "end_ms": 143170,
      "text": "一九三九年战火纷飞他和物理学家张文玉在昆明成了婚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00052",
      "start_ms": 143670,
      "end_ms": 146590,
      "text": "一九四一年两口子一起赴美留学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00053",
      "start_ms": 146690,
      "end_ms": 148810,
      "text": "进了密歇根大学王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00054",
      "start_ms": 148830,
      "end_ms": 153340,
      "text": "败在世界物理学权威人物乌伦贝克门下王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00055",
      "start_ms": 153340,
      "end_ms": 154700,
      "text": "这个学生有多恐怖？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00056",
      "start_ms": 155180,
      "end_ms": 157620,
      "text": "一九四四年拿到博士学位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00057",
      "start_ms": 158100,
      "end_ms": 159120,
      "text": "一九五一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00058",
      "start_ms": 159140,
      "end_ms": 165700,
      "text": "他和导师一起解开了困扰国际学界多年的气体书韵难题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00059",
      "start_ms": 165740,
      "end_ms": 176840,
      "text": "方程直接以两个人的姓氏命名王成书乌伦贝克方程简称WCU方程学术发表即轰动世件。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00060",
      "start_ms": 177260,
      "end_ms": 178160,
      "text": "直到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00061",
      "start_ms": 178180,
      "end_ms": 179475,
      "text": "这个领域的论文里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00062",
      "start_ms": 179790,
      "end_ms": 183670,
      "text": "还在引用导师乌伦贝克放话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00063",
      "start_ms": 183750,
      "end_ms": 187825,
      "text": "我这个学生只要留在美国诺贝尔奖就是时间问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00064",
      "start_ms": 188540,
      "end_ms": 190085,
      "text": "诺贝尔奖啊朋友们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00065",
      "start_ms": 190560,
      "end_ms": 193625,
      "text": "多少人一辈子摸不着边的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00066",
      "start_ms": 194060,
      "end_ms": 195835,
      "text": "在他那儿就是个时间问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00067",
      "start_ms": 196700,
      "end_ms": 198395,
      "text": "可就在这个节骨眼上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00068",
      "start_ms": 198860,
      "end_ms": 201185,
      "text": "一九四九年十月一日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00069",
      "start_ms": 201700,
      "end_ms": 204365,
      "text": "新中国成立的消息漂洋过海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00070",
      "start_ms": 205060,
      "end_ms": 209945,
      "text": "王成书和张文玉做了个让所有美国同行崩溃的决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00071",
      "start_ms": 210750,
      "end_ms": 213375,
      "text": "回到祖国美国这边不放牛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00072",
      "start_ms": 214410,
      "end_ms": 216395,
      "text": "朝鲜战争刚刚爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00073",
      "start_ms": 217180,
      "end_ms": 223365,
      "text": "美方直接禁止中国学者李靖中间不乏监视传讯扣资料。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00074",
      "start_ms": 224210,
      "end_ms": 226365,
      "text": "有个美国教授说的更直白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00075",
      "start_ms": 226890,
      "end_ms": 230895,
      "text": "这些人回去就是潜在的核武制造者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00076",
      "start_ms": 231870,
      "end_ms": 232665,
      "text": "越阻拦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00077",
      "start_ms": 232880,
      "end_ms": 233775,
      "text": "他越铁了心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00078",
      "start_ms": 234360,
      "end_ms": 235825,
      "text": "为了保住科研资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00079",
      "start_ms": 236390,
      "end_ms": 239195,
      "text": "他把书刊分成三百多个邮包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00080",
      "start_ms": 240000,
      "end_ms": 241480,
      "text": "跑去不同的邮局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00081",
      "start_ms": 241840,
      "end_ms": 250580,
      "text": "像蚂蚁搬家一样一点点寄回北京邮包的重量加起来足足有九百公斤左右。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00082",
      "start_ms": 251640,
      "end_ms": 253160,
      "text": "夹当宋人的宋人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00083",
      "start_ms": 253520,
      "end_ms": 256019,
      "text": "美方开出再优渥的条件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00084",
      "start_ms": 256200,
      "end_ms": 257880,
      "text": "他眼皮都不抬一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00085",
      "start_ms": 259260,
      "end_ms": 260820,
      "text": "整整七年的时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00086",
      "start_ms": 260980,
      "end_ms": 263740,
      "text": "国家在日内瓦谈判上据理力争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00087",
      "start_ms": 264280,
      "end_ms": 266320,
      "text": "美国不得不解除禁令。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00088",
      "start_ms": 267000,
      "end_ms": 268540,
      "text": "一九五六年十月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00089",
      "start_ms": 269000,
      "end_ms": 271490,
      "text": "双脚一踏上祖国的土地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00090",
      "start_ms": 271930,
      "end_ms": 276810,
      "text": "他在笔记里就写在离别的十五年的祖国国境上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00091",
      "start_ms": 277230,
      "end_ms": 280030,
      "text": "第一次看到五星红旗在空中飘扬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00092",
      "start_ms": 280510,
      "end_ms": 282010,
      "text": "心里说不出的兴奋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00093",
      "start_ms": 282510,
      "end_ms": 284170,
      "text": "我要为国家做贡献，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00094",
      "start_ms": 284430,
      "end_ms": 285590,
      "text": "国家需要什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00095",
      "start_ms": 285690,
      "end_ms": 287410,
      "text": "我就干什么这话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00096",
      "start_ms": 287410,
      "end_ms": 289695,
      "text": "他真就用一辈子去兑现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00097",
      "start_ms": 290370,
      "end_ms": 291270,
      "text": "一九五八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00098",
      "start_ms": 291710,
      "end_ms": 293070,
      "text": "前三强上门找，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00099",
      "start_ms": 293070,
      "end_ms": 297030,
      "text": "他说国家要建热核聚变研究室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00100",
      "start_ms": 297110,
      "end_ms": 298810,
      "text": "国内这个项目还一片空白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00101",
      "start_ms": 299010,
      "end_ms": 300550,
      "text": "让你挑头干不干。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00102",
      "start_ms": 301330,
      "end_ms": 302690,
      "text": "他已经四十六岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00103",
      "start_ms": 302930,
      "end_ms": 304370,
      "text": "专业已经定了型，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00104",
      "start_ms": 304910,
      "end_ms": 307470,
      "text": "这跟研究了二十年的锡箔气体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00105",
      "start_ms": 307470,
      "end_ms": 308890,
      "text": "根本是两码事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00106",
      "start_ms": 309390,
      "end_ms": 311750,
      "text": "等于从教授退回小学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00107",
      "start_ms": 312110,
      "end_ms": 313710,
      "text": "但是他只回了仨字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00108",
      "start_ms": 314150,
      "end_ms": 314850,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00109",
      "start_ms": 315470,
      "end_ms": 316650,
      "text": "一九六一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00110",
      "start_ms": 316830,
      "end_ms": 318870,
      "text": "苏联的专家全部撤走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00111",
      "start_ms": 319250,
      "end_ms": 320880,
      "text": "图纸也卷走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00112",
      "start_ms": 321080,
      "end_ms": 322840,
      "text": "核抱最要命的一步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00113",
      "start_ms": 323520,
      "end_ms": 325300,
      "text": "浓缩又卡死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00114",
      "start_ms": 326160,
      "end_ms": 328299,
      "text": "前三强把话给他挑明了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00115",
      "start_ms": 328980,
      "end_ms": 331160,
      "text": "这件事要绝对保密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00116",
      "start_ms": 331380,
      "end_ms": 332560,
      "text": "不能发表论文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00117",
      "start_ms": 332560,
      "end_ms": 335600,
      "text": "不能出席任何学术会议去向。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00118",
      "start_ms": 335640,
      "end_ms": 337080,
      "text": "不能告诉任何人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00119",
      "start_ms": 337420,
      "end_ms": 338580,
      "text": "包括你的丈夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00120",
      "start_ms": 339460,
      "end_ms": 342240,
      "text": "干这个项目等于物理学家王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00121",
      "start_ms": 342260,
      "end_ms": 344500,
      "text": "这个人就在社会上消失了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00122",
      "start_ms": 345040,
      "end_ms": 347680,
      "text": "四十九岁的他还是那三个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00123",
      "start_ms": 347920,
      "end_ms": 348760,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00124",
      "start_ms": 349740,
      "end_ms": 350730,
      "text": "一九九六二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00125",
      "start_ms": 350730,
      "end_ms": 354465,
      "text": "他悄悄离京去了甘肃兰州的武陵寺场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00126",
      "start_ms": 355270,
      "end_ms": 356875,
      "text": "丈夫在外承担任务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00127",
      "start_ms": 357200,
      "end_ms": 360115,
      "text": "儿子一个人在北京读寄宿学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00128",
      "start_ms": 360680,
      "end_ms": 362785,
      "text": "一家三口天各一方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00129",
      "start_ms": 363540,
      "end_ms": 369740,
      "text": "他提出分九批启动第五批取料的方案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00130",
      "start_ms": 369740,
      "end_ms": 373785,
      "text": "把投产周期整整缩短了一百一十三天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00131",
      "start_ms": 374980,
      "end_ms": 377165,
      "text": "一九六四年一月十四日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00132",
      "start_ms": 377930,
      "end_ms": 383965,
      "text": "新中国第一批风度百分之九十以上的合格核燃料下线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00133",
      "start_ms": 384500,
      "end_ms": 385180,
      "text": "九个月后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00134",
      "start_ms": 385280,
      "end_ms": 386875,
      "text": "罗布泊一声巨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00135",
      "start_ms": 387800,
      "end_ms": 390515,
      "text": "聂荣臻向毛主席汇报成功的消息。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00136",
      "start_ms": 391280,
      "end_ms": 392065,
      "text": "毛主席说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00137",
      "start_ms": 392830,
      "end_ms": 395795,
      "text": "这是中国第一颗核爆的女功臣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00138",
      "start_ms": 396970,
      "end_ms": 398985,
      "text": "可举国欢庆的人群里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00139",
      "start_ms": 399500,
      "end_ms": 400875,
      "text": "根本没有王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00140",
      "start_ms": 401330,
      "end_ms": 405220,
      "text": "组织上询问他继续隐姓埋名干下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00141",
      "start_ms": 405440,
      "end_ms": 406280,
      "text": "你愿意吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00142",
      "start_ms": 406380,
      "end_ms": 407025,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00143",
      "start_ms": 407680,
      "end_ms": 408280,
      "text": "第三次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00144",
      "start_ms": 408280,
      "end_ms": 409985,
      "text": "王成书又答应了下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00145",
      "start_ms": 410250,
      "end_ms": 412035,
      "text": "从此他继续藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00146",
      "start_ms": 412430,
      "end_ms": 415855,
      "text": "一直藏到一九七七年才回到北京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00147",
      "start_ms": 416700,
      "end_ms": 419955,
      "text": "一九八零年当选中国科学院学部委员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00148",
      "start_ms": 420360,
      "end_ms": 422675,
      "text": "可老百姓压根儿不知道他是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00149",
      "start_ms": 423310,
      "end_ms": 425150,
      "text": "一九九四年六月十八日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00150",
      "start_ms": 425150,
      "end_ms": 427245,
      "text": "八十二岁的王成书病逝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00151",
      "start_ms": 428190,
      "end_ms": 429985,
      "text": "当众公布遗嘱时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00152",
      "start_ms": 430440,
      "end_ms": 433525,
      "text": "所有人沉默了不办丧事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00153",
      "start_ms": 433870,
      "end_ms": 437780,
      "text": "遗体捐给医学研究毕昇书籍资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00154",
      "start_ms": 438040,
      "end_ms": 447235,
      "text": "送给核工业研究院零存整取的七千两百二十二点八八元作为最后一次党费上交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00155",
      "start_ms": 447880,
      "end_ms": 452464,
      "text": "其余约十万元的积蓄全部捐给国家的希望工程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00156",
      "start_ms": 452990,
      "end_ms": 456205,
      "text": "他本可以站在诺贝尔奖的领奖台台上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00157",
      "start_ms": 456680,
      "end_ms": 459565,
      "text": "最后却站在大西北的稿纸堆里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00158",
      "start_ms": 460110,
      "end_ms": 461775,
      "text": "他本可以名满天下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00159",
      "start_ms": 462290,
      "end_ms": 467695,
      "text": "最后连儿子都不知道妈妈这些年到底在哪在干些什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00160",
      "start_ms": 468760,
      "end_ms": 473295,
      "text": "这就是王成书蘑菇云里有他的一份，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00161",
      "start_ms": 473800,
      "end_ms": 475865,
      "text": "他却不肯留自己的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00162",
      "start_ms": 476390,
      "end_ms": 479800,
      "text": "王成书的故事就写在国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00163",
      "start_ms": 479800,
      "end_ms": 480505,
      "text": "这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00164",
      "start_ms": 481210,
      "end_ms": 482605,
      "text": "书中还有四十多位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00165",
      "start_ms": 482960,
      "end_ms": 484040,
      "text": "像他这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00166",
      "start_ms": 484040,
      "end_ms": 487230,
      "text": "每一位拿出来都能让你红着眼况。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00167",
      "start_ms": 487230,
      "end_ms": 491485,
      "text": "看完想要深入了解这些为国隐身的国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00168",
      "start_ms": 491890,
      "end_ms": 494345,
      "text": "点左下角链接直接带走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00169",
      "start_ms": 494640,
      "end_ms": 495365,
      "text": "给自己看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00170",
      "start_ms": 495700,
      "end_ms": 497295,
      "text": "给孩子看都值得。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00171",
      "start_ms": 497860,
      "end_ms": 501235,
      "text": "但这只是开始一个能拿诺贝尔奖的女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00172",
      "start_ms": 501980,
      "end_ms": 504545,
      "text": "为什么心甘情愿消失三十年？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00173",
      "start_ms": 505410,
      "end_ms": 509985,
      "text": "他在美国被扣的那七年到底经历了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00174",
      "start_ms": 510890,
      "end_ms": 511595,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00175",
      "start_ms": 512090,
      "end_ms": 513435,
      "text": "下一集更震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00176",
      "start_ms": 514780,
      "end_ms": 516925,
      "text": "如果你被这个故事触动到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00177",
      "start_ms": 517390,
      "end_ms": 518025,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00178",
      "start_ms": 519860,
      "end_ms": 520700,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b225d87255676fa_s00179",
      "start_ms": 520840,
      "end_ms": 523335,
      "text": "转发给您的家人、朋友一起来看。"
    }
  ],
